== Overview ==
Upgraded Giant Turkey Toilet is a Boss that was added in the Thanksgiving 2024 Event. 

== Trivia ==

*This is the only event toilet that has been upgraded.
*This is heavily inspired by its previous counterpart, just upgraded.
*Even though it been the upgraded version of the [[Giant Turkey Toilet]]. Upgraded Giant Turkey Toilet can't shoot a laser, like the [[Giant Turkey Toilet]] can do.

